[-] baroque		<-->	adjective++C2	[220911][002]	./bəˈrɒk/-NAmE /bəˈrəʊk/ (also Baroque)
[usually before noun] [t]
	;tt. nghệ thuật châu Âu thế kỷ 17-18 -- (1) used to describe European architecture, art and music of the 17th and early 18th centuries that has a grand and highly decorated style
		;baroque churches/music
		;the baroque period
		;Topics HISTORYC2, Musicc2, Artc2, Buildingsc2
				;Oxford Collocations Dictionary
				;Baroque is used with these nouns:
				;cathedraleramusic…
